# Line endings are LF everywhere, whatever core.autocrlf says on the host:
# .editorconfig, rustfmt (newline_style = "Unix") and the ts-rs export all
# write LF, and the ladder's rung 3b compares the exported bindings with
# `git status`, which must not see a CRLF/LF round trip as a change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
